{"text": "La abuela vio al lobo acercarse y se escondió en la despensa. El lobo entró, se puso un gorro y se acostó bajo la manta. Quería que Caperucita lo confundiera con su abuela. Abuela, en voz baja: Esperaré aquí y pediré ayuda.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.315833, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.330583, "end": 0.670249, "from": 3, "to": 9}, {"start": 0.685041, "end": 0.936124, "from": 10, "to": 13}, {"start": 0.950875, "end": 1.05425, "from": 14, "to": 16}, {"start": 1.069041, "end": 1.349624, "from": 17, "to": 21}, {"start": 1.364375, "end": 2.117583, "from": 22, "to": 31}, {"start": 2.132333, "end": 2.206166, "from": 32, "to": 33}, {"start": 2.220958, "end": 2.368624, "from": 34, "to": 36}, {"start": 2.383416, "end": 2.959374, "from": 37, "to": 45}, {"start": 2.974166, "end": 3.047999, "from": 46, "to": 48}, {"start": 3.06275, "end": 3.136583, "from": 49, "to": 51}, {"start": 3.151375, "end": 3.889791, "from": 52, "to": 60}, {"start": 4.917875, "end": 5.124625, "from": 62, "to": 64}, {"start": 5.139416, "end": 5.390499, "from": 65, "to": 69}, {"start": 5.40525, "end": 5.81875, "from": 70, "to": 75}, {"start": 6.158416, "end": 6.335624, "from": 77, "to": 79}, {"start": 6.350416, "end": 6.690082, "from": 80, "to": 84}, {"start": 6.704875, "end": 6.852541, "from": 85, "to": 87}, {"start": 6.867333, "end": 7.310374, "from": 88, "to": 93}, {"start": 7.325125, "end": 7.398958, "from": 94, "to": 95}, {"start": 7.41375, "end": 7.561416, "from": 96, "to": 98}, {"start": 7.576208, "end": 8.048791, "from": 99, "to": 105}, {"start": 8.063583, "end": 8.344166, "from": 106, "to": 110}, {"start": 8.358916, "end": 8.462291, "from": 111, "to": 113}, {"start": 8.477083, "end": 8.993958, "from": 114, "to": 119}, {"start": 10.013, "end": 10.41175, "from": 121, "to": 127}, {"start": 10.4265, "end": 10.574166, "from": 128, "to": 131}, {"start": 10.588958, "end": 11.312624, "from": 132, "to": 142}, {"start": 11.327375, "end": 11.445541, "from": 143, "to": 145}, {"star